      85.68,
      354.6,
      251.88,
      381.96
    ],
    "text": "(AMENDMENT) ACT, No. 28 of 1964 Notice under Section 7",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      380.98,
      286.68,
      479.1
    ],
    "text": "My Reference No. PLDS/LNDO4/ACQ/42. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which are required for the public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599039554595947,
      10.078991889953613,
      11.038795471191406,
      11.998800277709961
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      479.83,
      289.08,
      636.08
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land /Servitude to be Acquired: Lot No. 838, 839, 840 as depicted in the Sheet No. 36 and the Extra No. 34 in the Final Village Plan No. 208 prepared by the Superintend of Surveyor Rathnapura, situated in the Grama Niladhari Division of 172 Lellopitiya in Meda Paththuwa in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Pelmadulla of Rathnapura District in Sabaragamuwa Province. Lot No. 838\u2014Extent: 0.0216 Hectare North: Lot Nos. 746, 748, 747 and 841; East: Lot Nos. 746, 747 and 841; South: Lot No. 839; West: Lot Nos. 746 and 748.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      13.918607711791992
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      637.52,
      336.62,
      704.96
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 839\u2014Extent: 0.2855 Hectare North: Lot Nos. 756, 750, 746, 749, 838, 841, 840 and 842; East: Lot Nos. 840, 841 and 842; South: Lot 233 1/2, 233 and 235; West: Lot Nos. 756, 750, 746 and 749.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      331.52,
      577.1,
      375.92
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 840\u2014Extent: 0.0107 Hectare North: Lot Nos. 840, 741 and 842; East: Lot Nos. 840, 741 and 842; South: Lot No. 839; West: Lot Nos. 839 and 840.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      395.12,
      591.92,
      548.72
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat Office of Pelmadulla on the 2nd November 2015 at 10.00 a. m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 2nd November, 2015 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      552.56,
      539.64,
      687.92
    ],
    "text": "A. SUGATH SISIRA KUMARA, Divisional Secretary, Pelmadulla. Divisional Secretariat, Pelmadulla. 14th September, 2015.",
